  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The definitive open-source platform for patient-specific cardiovascular haemodynamic simulation — no comparable open alternative covers the full pipeline from image segmentation to CFD analysis. 313 GitHub stars for a highly specialised scientific computing tool reflects strong domain adoption. BSD-style licence, actively maintained (May 2026), with Stanford and UC Regents pedigree and extensive peer-reviewed publications. Essential for any team working on computational cardiovascular medicine, surgical planning, or vascular device evaluation.",
